WEBVTT

00:01:57.999 --> 00:02:02.019
First, the vagus nerve, which runs through
the body into the brain,

00:02:02.019 --> 00:02:05.337
quickly transmits the information
to the brain stem,

00:02:05.337 --> 00:02:09.422
passing near an important area
of pain processing.

00:02:09.422 --> 00:02:12.993
Second, cytokines travel through
the body to the hypothalamus,

00:02:12.993 --> 00:02:15.924
the part of the brain responsible
for controlling temperature,

00:02:15.924 --> 00:02:16.899
thirst,

00:02:16.899 --> 00:02:17.789
hunger,

00:02:17.789 --> 00:02:18.919
and sleep,

00:02:18.919 --> 00:02:20.558
among other things.

00:02:20.558 --> 00:02:22.076
When it receives this message,

00:02:22.076 --> 00:02:24.426
the hypothalamus produces
another molecule

00:02:24.426 --> 00:02:28.995
called prostaglandin E2,
which gears it up for war.

00:02:28.995 --> 00:02:32.765
The hypothalamus sends signals
that instruct your muscles to contract